  {P : Finset ℕ},
  (∀ i ∈ P, ∃ s, u ≤ s ∧ s < u + n ∧ producer n s = i ∧ ∃ j, Molt.inForce n Δconf c₀ i s ≤ j ∧ Stolen i j) →
